# Training checkpoints and stray exports stay out of the repo...
*.onnx
*.pt
# ...except the one model the ml-service image needs. It is ~4 MB after int8
# quantisation, which is small enough to version alongside the code that
# depends on it. That keeps deployment to "git push" with no model registry,
# no download at boot, and no way for the model and the thresholds that
# calibrate it to drift apart.
!models/classifier.onnx
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
/tmp/
eval/golden_set/*
!eval/golden_set/README.md
